  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>30</span><font>2024.08</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>兼容月报｜行业应用多元化兼容 万里数据库7月适配成果一览</h2> <b>2024.08.30</b> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">共筑国产生态圈</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">数字基础设施的建设离不开产业链上下游生态企业的携手共进。万里数据库作为国产数据库领先品牌，自成立以来，积极参与信创产业生态建设，在国产生态兼容适配建设、生态融合等方面持续发力，全面推进从芯片到操作系统、服务器、中间件及各类应用软件的全方位兼容适配工作，共筑国产生态圈。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">基于此背景，万里数据库未来将持续发布生态适配月报，诚邀广大产业链伙伴，共同见证基于万里安全数据库GreatDB的生态建设成果。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p><img src=\"https://pics1.baidu.com/feed/8ad4b31c8701a18b4ba88c5d8e6c8a062838fe37@f_auto?token=f05391274b3cf52c357e35a11d4b7d9d&f=jpeg\" width=\"652\" height=\"293\"/></p><p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">2024年7月，万里数据库与</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(184, 37, 37); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">华为、浪潮、中科曙光、中科可控、航天706所、青岛凯亚、广州邦讯、飞友科技</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">等<span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">16</span>家生态伙伴累计完成<span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">41</span>款产品兼容适配，充分证明万里安全数据库GreatDB产品具备</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">高度的成熟性与稳定性</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，以及对国产生态各链条产品的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">高度兼容性</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">。通过近5年国产生态适配方面的持续投入与建设，万里数据库生态体系进一步完善壮大，以持续的行动与努力为构建多元、协同、共赢的全国产生态链添砖加瓦。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://pics2.baidu.com/feed/ae51f3deb48f8c54ac334d002b6aa0fbe1fe7f8a@f_auto?token=ff1184bd671fe1fb116afb8fa3b5f5e8&f=jpeg\" width=\"723\" height=\"457\"/></p><p class=\"contentText contentCaption\" style=\"padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; letter-spacing: 0.2px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-top: 0.095rem !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span class=\"bjh-image-caption center\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 0.13rem; line-height: 0.18rem; display: block; color: rgb(132, 134, 145); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">7月适配认证列表</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">此次适配产品覆盖</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">操作系统、服务器、CPU、云平台、安全产品以及应用软件</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">等多个产业链环节。测试结果表明：万里安全数据库GreatDB与上述产品完全兼容，整体运行稳定高效。GreatDB用产品技术能力，验证了从底层基础软硬件到上层业务应用的全栈兼容能力，有力支撑信创产业稳步发展。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p><img src=\"https://pics1.baidu.com/feed/b151f8198618367afd2d038c3e3006dab21ce588@f_auto?token=66bb6eac96394cf4b581afa0634c29e8&f=png\" width=\"768\" height=\"558\"/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">应用生态多点开花 赋能诸多重点行业</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">尤其值得一提的是，万里数据库7月与</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; ba